//! dns.lookup and dns.lookupService run getaddrinfo and getnameinfo on the runtime's blocking
//! threads. Resolver queries drive a `silk.net.dns.query.Exchange` on the runtime loop: each server
//! gets a nonblocking UDP socket in the runtime reactor, and a TCP try runs on a blocking thread.
//! poll owns all JS calls; retained callback roots are released after delivery or during close.
